        "answer": {
          "short": "\\$37 601.82 per year",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Annual income}&=5461\\times26\\\\\\text{Annual income}&=\\$141\\,986\\end{align*}$$\nFourth tax bracket.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Excess}&=141\\,986-120\\,000\\\\\\text{Excess}&=\\$21\\,986\\\\\\text{Annual tax payable}&=29\\,467+0.37\\times21\\,986\\\\\\text{Annual tax payable}&=\\$37\\,601.82\\end{align*}$$",
